The [[Spectral Dagger]] is an item normally obtained by catalytically crafting a [[Dagger]] with a [[Mana Orb]]. It deals low damage, less even than the [[Dagger]], though it has the ability to spend {{icon/mana}} to deal decent damage instead. Like all daggers, the [[Spectral Dagger]] also attacks on stun.

While not the most powerful of the [[Dagger]] upgrades, it's arguably the easiest to craft, and can be a reasonable soak for excess {{icon/mana}}.
